OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Swinney questioned on
OL,4,A'gathering mess' of public service
OL,5,Areform
OL,6,
OL,7,FScottish Labour leader Michael Marra
OL,8,Faccuses the Scottish government of
OL,9,Fgiving "no real clarity" on public
OL,10,Fservice reform, including reducing the
OL,11,Fnumber of local authorities and merging
OL,12,Fhealth boards. "This is a gathering
OL,13,Fmess," he says
OL,15,FJohn Swinney insists he is committed to
OL,16,Ffinding agreement saying that if he had
OL,17,Fcome to parliament with a definitive
OL,18,Fplan then Marra would accuse him of not
OL,19,Fengaging in dialogue
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
