OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Swinney questioned on
OL,4,A'gathering mess' of public service
OL,5,Areform
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor the second week in a row the FM is
OL,8,Fquizzed on Scotland's drug problem.
OL,9,FReform UK Scotland leader Malcolm
OL,10,FOfford accuses the government of not
OL,11,Ftaking the issue seriously
OL,13,FThe first minister defends his approach
OL,14,Fand adds that he has actioned a review
OL,15,Fof official strategy in light of the
OL,16,Favailability of lethal synthetic drugs
